<title>TAIWAN: Cathay Construction H1 net profit soars.</title>
<headline>Cathay Construction H1 net profit soars.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	     (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    604  vs     223</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 612  vs     255</p>
<p>    Turnover			    1,900  vs   1,609</p>
<p>Note: Cathay Construction Company, Taiwan's largest construction firm, did not give any explanation for the sharp rise in its profits.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
